00:03:37,500 --> 00:03:43,500
A Whole New Breed of Heroes.

2
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:21,000
TMNT is a adventure, animation, comedy film directed by Kevin Munroe.

3
00:10:52,500 --> 00:10:58,500
After the defeat of their old arch nemesis, The Shredder,
the Turtles have grown apart as a family.

4
00:14:30,000 --> 00:14:36,000
Struggling to keep them together, their rat sensei, Splinter, becomes
worried when strange things begin to brew in New York City.

5
00:18:07,500 --> 00:18:13,500
Leonardo (voice), played by James Arnold Taylor.

6
00:21:45,000 --> 00:21:51,000
Donatello / Additional Voices (voice), played by Mitchell Whitfield.

7
00:25:22,500 --> 00:25:28,500
Raphael / Nightwatcher (voice), played by Nolan North.

8
